                                    <desc type="GuestText">Invocation entitled ‘Baʾǝnta qǝddǝsāt salāmāwit’, written in a small and slanted script.</desc>
                                    <q xml:lang="gez">በእንተ፡ ቅድሳት፡ ሰላማዊት፡ ሰላመ፡ ናስ<supplied reason="omitted">ተ</supplied>በቍዕ፡ ከመ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ያስተሳልመነ። በሣህለ፡ ዚአሁ። በእንተ፡ <sic>ሃይማኖተነ፡</sic> <sic>ናስ<supplied reason="omitted">ተ</supplied>በቁዕ፡</sic><gap reason="ellipsis"/></q>
                                </item>
                                <item xml:id="a2">
