                    <history>
                        <origin>
                            <origDate notBefore="1700" notAfter="1899" evidence="lettering">Eighteenth or nineteenth century</origDate>
                        </origin>
                        <provenance>The manuscript can be palaeographically dated to the 18th or 19th century.
                            The manuscript came into possession of Governor Ferdinardo Martini between 
                            <date notBefore="1897" notAfter="1907">1897 and 1907</date> and was later acquired by the 
                            Biblioteca Forteguerriana between <date notBefore="1930" notAfter="1931">1930 and 1931</date>. 
                            The book is mentioned in <bibl><ptr target="bm:Zanutto1932Bibliografia"></ptr><citedRange>81-84</citedRange></bibl>. It was first catalogued in <bibl><ptr target="bm:Lusini2002Pistoia"/></bibl></provenance>
